ror": false}, {"t_ms": 11526, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). It is now reporting healthy, with the error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n\n- **Why v2.3.0:** v2.3.1 is the current release and is unhealthy. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.2.9 is older, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api. It describes the v2.3.1 failure, the rollback to v2.3.0 in all regions, and the next steps. The on-call engineer was paged.\n\nThe v2.3.1 failure still needs investigation before anyone redeploys it.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01TxzLJv7kzmMGtjD5YviNt5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01HD1A1idnvjQQ9kVnvGYN6i", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The current production version is v2.3.1, which is unhealthy. The most recent release that was healthy in production is v2.3.0 (v2.2.9 is older). I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Hm3yi6rXTeeNUdh8B3AvGB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01K7ZHyjctRs42vgStUXqR56", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01UFnu7SB3LRiwfot5mVr4dd", 